MediaPipe Tasks vision runtime and the face/pose landmarker models are
Google's MediaPipe models, used here under the Apache License 2.0.

https://developers.google.com/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/pose_landmarker
https://developers.google.com/edge/mediapipe/solutions/vision/face_landmarker

The .task files in this folder are stored so the camera can start without
downloading them from storage.googleapis.com at runtime. The WebAssembly
runtime is copied from @mediapipe/tasks-vision during npm install and is not
committed.
